        '[HIGHLIGHT: The deconditioning spiral is the most modifiable driver in PPCS, and the EP is the right clinician to address it. The challenge is preventing it through early mobilisation — which is precisely why the paradigm shift from rest to active rehabilitation covered in Module 1 matters beyond just the acute phase.]',
